This build context embeds Tencent HunyuanVideo-Foley source at commit
df7b005b5023df2a9b73e1d66dd51d452799884e under the Tencent Hunyuan
Community License Agreement. The custom Hugging Face Transformers fork is
pinned to the peeled source commit a957b7911a758d54597914b4479fe6e81424d64f
behind the official v4.49.0-SigLIP-2 tag, and Descript Audiotools is pinned
to commit 348ebf2034ce24e2a91a553e3171cb00c0c71678.

The Transformers archive is stored as three deterministic, transport-bounded
chunks. The Docker build verifies every chunk, reassembles them in fixed order,
and verifies the original archive SHA-256 before extraction.

The files under pipelines/ are Vonk Forge wrappers for the signed job contract.
